Restrict the ALFF and fALFF computation of :class:`.ALFFParcels`, :class:`.ALFFSpheres` and :class:`.ALFFMaps` to the voxels in their ``masks`` (with ``-mask`` for AFNI's ``3dRSFC``), as for ReHo, reducing the memory and time (e.g., from 14.5 GB to 9.4 GB and from 7 to 1 minutes for 1200 volumes with AFNI), and do not write the bandpassed time series with ``3dRSFC`` (``-no_rs_out``), as only the parameters are used by `Fede Raimondo`_
